    <p style="text-align:center;color:var(--pink);font-weight:bold;font-size:17px;line-height:2.2">
     mawhhhhh 💋<br>mawhhhhh 💋<br>mawhhhhh 💋<br>MAWHHHHHHHHH 💋💋<br>
     okay enough kisses.<br>WAIT NO.<br>MAWHHHHHHHHH 💋💗
    </p>
    <p style="text-align:right;color:var(--pink)"><b>~ Ur Malkin ♡</b></p>
   </div>
   <div class="divider">♡ ━━━ ♡</div>
   <button class="pixelbtn green" onclick="completeQuest('q2',20,'LETTER QUEST COMPLETE 💗')">LETTER RECEIVED ♡</button>
